      "text": "(d) Nominate three or more candidates for appointment to each vacancy arising each in such office and submit to the Mayor the names of the nominees and such information as may be necessary to inform the Mayor of the qualifications of each nominee; provided that when the Committee have received recommendations of persons for consideration as provided by law, the Committee may, where appropriate, nominate such persons or report its recommendation against the appointment of such persons to the Mayor; and provided further that if there is more than one vacancy on any commission, board or other public body the Committee may submit fewer than three nominations for each vacancy unless the Mayor specifically requests three nominations; and",
